From a1a45eefa4eb5ba06d0eb8a316b0eac4e3470da5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:36:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 28/35] bitproxy: 'Fastest (auto)' in the server card with
 check interval

The dashboard server card gets a 'Fastest (auto)' option (sing-box
urltest over the servers sharing the tunnel address) next to the
individual servers; while it is selected, 'Check every' picks the test
interval (1, 3, 5, 10 or 30 min, default 10). The card shows which
server is in use and its latency, or that no server answers. Picking a
specific server switches back to manual.
---
